# Keys these configuration files carry that no section declares. Regenerate with
# -update.
#
# A migration builds sei.toml from the declared keys, so every line here is a value
# these files hold that the migration reads past. What that means depends on which
# files were read, and the test that names this record says which.
#
# Read through the same source the migration reads, so this measures what that
# migration would actually see rather than what a struct's tags suggest.

abci
eth_block_test.eth_block_test_enabled
eth_block_test.eth_block_test_test_data_path
filter-peers
iavl-disable-fastnode
receipt-store.keep-recent
receipt-store.tx-index-backend
sei.mode
sei.version
state-store.ss-evm-db-directory
state-store.ss-keep-last-version
state-store.ss-use-default-comparer
